(b) the number of lakes in which work has started and have been completed and the average capacity of the lake constructed in each State; and
(c) details thereof in Gorakhpur district?

(a) whether it is a fact that 33 per cent of all the appointments to be made in the Police Force of the country have been reserved for women candidates; 
(b) if so, the relevant Government Order in this regard; and
(c) the percentage of women working in the Police Force across various States of the country and the number of women related crimes registered in said States, according to the data as compiled by National Crime Records Bureau (NCRB)?

(a) the ratio of students doing graduate/postgraduate/research/post-research education/research in various universities of the country;
(b) whether there is academic pressure on the teachers of the university due to the large number of graduate students and this has a negative impact on the quality of postgraduate education and research work; and
(c) whether Government would consider restricting undergraduate education to colleges or subject-specific educational institutions?

(a) the number of houses applied for, sanctioned, and constructed, respectively, under Pradhan Mantri Awas Yojana-Urban (PMAY-U) as against the population of various States and Union Territories of the country;
(b) whether some of the States have made any changes in the nature and amount of funds sanctioned, if so, the details thereof, and impact thereof on the said scheme; and
(c) the States in which this scheme is not implemented, and the details of the scheme being implemented over there for the purpose?

(a) the number of proposals received and  agreements signed for setting up new industries in various States and Union Territories of the country, in proportion to their population during the last three years;
(b) the number of industries where manufacturing work has started and the industries where actual production has started; and 
(c) the number of persons likely to get direct and indirect employment therefrom?

(a) the area of paddy/wet land in various districts of Kerala for which the land use has been changed for other purposes since the implementation of the Kerala Conservation of Paddy Land and Wet Land Act, 2008;
(b) whether permission under section 10 of the said Act was obtained for the said changes, if so, the case-wise details of the grounds on which such permission was granted; and 
(c) the details of the action taken under Sections 20/23/24 of the said Act since its implementation?

(a) the amount which is paid as Fixed Medical Allowance to the retired Central Government employees by Government;
(b) the year in which the said amount was decided and whether it has ever been increased; and
(c) whether Government would consider increasing this amount?

(a) the overall and per capita agricultural loan distributed in various States of the country during the last three years;
(b) the per capita consumption of electricity, fertilizers and agricultural equipment by farmers in these States; and
(c) the per capita average agricultural production and per capita farmer income in these States during said period?
